WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:05.520
Exploring Mpumalanga in South Africa
is a photographer's dream.

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:10.360
You sense the vastness of the place. 

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.880
It's probably one of the most
beautiful landscapes I've ever seen.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:21.560
In a single day, you can go from rugged
mountains to these vast plains.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:28.440
You add this dimension of big game
and it makes it a totally unique experience.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.760
This landscape is really meant to be
explored and experienced,

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.240
and doing things like this
really gives me a sense of the place.

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:49.320
There's something unique about watching
the sunset over a South African landscape.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:54.120
It gives this incredible light
that you don't see anywhere else.

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:57.120
It's truly a spectacular experience. 

